claim.claim-text:
a DC blocking component electrically connected between a neutral of the transformer and a ground;
a switching assembly electrically connected in parallel with the DC blocking component;
a current measuring device configured to measure an alternating current across the DC blocking component; and
a control module, including a processing device, configured to:

determine that the overvoltage protection device has triggered;
upon the overvoltage protection device triggering, increment an overvoltage protection device trigger count; and
upon the overvoltage protection device trigger count exceeding a predetermined count threshold, generate an alarm.

a DC blocking component electrically connected between a neutral of the transformer and a ground;
a switching assembly electrically connected in parallel with the DC blocking component;
a voltage measuring device configured to measure a voltage across the DC blocking component; and
